{"id":"4acab55d1a2da070","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-metric-totally-bounded-space.md","title":"ZFC Metric Totally Bounded Space","display":"df-zfc-metric-totally-bounded-space — ZFC Metric Totally Bounded Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-metric-totally-bounded-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-metric-totally-bounded-space"],"display":"df-zfc-metric-totally-bounded-space — ZFC Metric Totally Bounded Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-metric.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-metric-totally-bounded-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-metric-totally-bounded-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-metric-totally-bounded-space — ZFC Metric Totally Bounded Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-metric.md\">../batch18/58-df-metric.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,d\\in V\">\\(X,d\\in V\\)</span> (carrier and metric)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricTotallyBoundedSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricTotallyBoundedSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Metric}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\)</span> (metric predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-metric.md\">../batch18/58-df-metric.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}totally\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}space} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricTotallyBoundedSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land\n\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists F\\subseteq X\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land\nX\\subseteq\\bigcup_{x\\in F}\\{y\\in X\\mid d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)&lt;\\epsilon\\}\\bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}totally\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}space} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricTotallyBoundedSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land\n\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists F\\subseteq X\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land\nX\\subseteq\\bigcup_{x\\in F}\\{y\\in X\\mid d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)&lt;\\epsilon\\}\\bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The metric is applied to an ordered pair, matching its upstream set-function signature.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-metric.md","status":"resolved","id":"267957a097ff75bf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-metric.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-metric.md","status":"resolved","id":"267957a097ff75bf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S$ (metric predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-metric.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ (finite-set predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricTotallyBoundedSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Metric}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}totally\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}space} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricTotallyBoundedSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land\n\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists F\\subseteq X\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land\nX\\subseteq\\bigcup_{x\\in F}\\{y\\in X\\mid d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)<\\epsilon\\}\\bigr)\n\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1178,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2694","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-metric-totally-bounded-space.md|58-df-zfc-metric-totally-bounded-space]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d9a25b0ac94a3598","267957a097ff75bf"]}